#: ../../source/overview/the-repositories.rst:5
msgid ""
"The project is **not** a monorepo. It is a set of repositories that "
"depend on each other at run time and are maintained independently, which "
"is the same decision as keeping formats out of the engine: coverage "
"should be able to grow without anyone touching the part that must not "
"change."
